---
import { siteConfig } from "../../data/siteConfig";
---

<section class="py-16 bg-[#0B1120] border-t border-slate-800">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center">
    <div class="rounded-2xl bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 p-8 sm:p-12">
      <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight">
        ¿Necesitas revisar o reparar tu electrodoméstico?
      </h2>

      <p class="text-slate-300 text-sm sm:text-base max-w-xl mx-auto mt-3 leading-relaxed">
        Comunícate directamente con nosotros para coordinar tu visita técnica a domicilio en Guayaquil, Samborondón o Durán con proforma previa y garantía por escrito.
      </p>

      <div class="mt-8 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-4">
        <a
          href={`https://wa.me/${siteConfig.whatsappNumber}?text=${encodeURIComponent(siteConfig.whatsappMessageDefault)}`}
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="w-full sm:w-auto px-8 py-3.5 rounded-xl bg-emerald-600 hover:bg-emerald-500 text-white font-semibold text-sm transition-colors shadow-lg shadow-emerald-950/40"
        >
          <span>Escribir por WhatsApp ({siteConfig.phoneFormatted})</span>
        </a>

        <a
          href={`tel:${siteConfig.phone.replace(/\s+/g, '')}`}
          class="w-full sm:w-auto px-8 py-3.5 rounded-xl bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-700 border border-slate-700 text-white font-semibold text-sm transition-colors"
        >
          <span>Llamar al Técnico</span>
        </a>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-8 pt-6 border-t border-slate-800/80 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-6 text-xs text-slate-400">
        <span>✓ 30 Días de Garantía</span>
        <span>✓ Proforma Digital en PDF</span>
        <span>✓ Guayaquil • Samborondón • Durán</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
